@host = http://localhost:5283
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@mealId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@pageNumber = 1
@pageSize = 10

### Meal - Get by Id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Meal/{{mealId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Meal - Get Paging
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Meal/Paging/{{pageNumber}}/{{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Meal - Create
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Meal
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

###

### Meal - Update
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/Meal
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "{{mealId}}"
}

###

### Meal - Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/Meal/{{mealId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


